                    DESCRIPTION "(2 intricacy points spent on cost). This is designed as a Lesser Power. More powerful knights may have this as a Greater Power (cost 2 points, Initiative –1, possibly with the cost adjusted down using intricacy), or may have Improved Damage on preferred weapon, or may stack Improved Damage and Damaging Effect."
                    REFERENCES {
                        "Lesser Power" -> #trycp5AY4LCEmvmCP10xvgWb ^"Lesser Power"
                        "Greater Power" -> #tO5XFGkxH39d8IsuOBi2cXBp ^"Greater Power"
                        "Improved Damage" -> #thH1bCzoiitnhPpJ0mq02EIG ^"Improved Damage"
                        "Improved Damage" -> #thH1bCzoiitnhPpJ0mq02EIG ^"Improved Damage"
