                ^"Appearance" STRING "The privy counselor looks like a young nobleman, and often claims to be the bastard of a duke who sent him away, but set him up in business. He uses his powers to maintain an apparently sumptuous home, after finding a site in a city where the Dominion is weaker than usual. He gains real money to fund his role, by stealing it using shapeshifting and enthrallment."
